    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305">

                <pb facs="0352" n="302" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg302"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pringle to Mr.
                            Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-14"><hi rendition="#italic">March 14,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Peterson informs that Imboden and Barnharts are confined, and will be obliged to
                    leave the country. Government of Honduras wishes to deal with party duly
                    authorized to treat. <hi rendition="#italic">Ranger</hi> still here.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Pringle.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
